CHANGELOG kicom
RELEASE "0.9.5" date="2026-09-15" change="Persistent Goal Layer and append-only ChatGPT memory archive"
RELEASE "0.9.6" date="2026-09-15" change="Bounded Autonomy Envelope, FreeOTP Human Authorization Bridge, rolling one-time sessions, direct trusted-source reads, direct self-update upload, append-only release archive and first-party feed publication"
FIX "0.9.6" change="MEMORY_ARCHIVE_BEGIN bridge ordering no longer collides with generic MEMORY_* handling"
POLICY "0.9.6" change="GitHub becomes optional mirror/transport rather than a trust anchor"
RELEASE "0.9.7" date="2026-09-15" change="Resilient autonomy session recovery, stale FreeOTP setup cleanup and semantically idempotent append-only release archival"
RELEASE "0.9.8" date="2026-09-15" change="Fast transport: larger trusted-source reads, large POST transport, batch/direct patch operations and protected server-side candidate builder using the unchanged verifier"
RELEASE "0.9.9" date="2026-09-15" change="Low-roundtrip control plane: source read leases, compact GET batch, semantic release preparation and robust PHP lint fallback"
RELEASE "0.9.10" date="2026-09-15" change="Transaction buffer for low-bandwidth chat clients and one-code execution of still-valid exact RED bindings after session idle"
RELEASE "0.9.11" date="2026-09-15" change="Adaptive transport: per-profile safe/probe fragment sizing, upward learning, explicit backoff and idempotent last-fragment retry"
RELEASE "0.9.12" date="2026-09-15" change="Session TOTP grace: normal autonomy-session opening accepts current plus configured recent past counters once; critical RED/production/kernel TOTP remains current-counter only"
RELEASE "0.9.13" date="2026-09-15" change="Semantic Codebook Transport: KCL-CODEBOOK/1 shared codes, SHA-bound contexts, compact GET/POST execution, binary gzip codec and live efficiency metrics"
RELEASE "0.9.14" date="2026-09-15" change="Added bounded AUTONOMY_TEST_HTTP for configured test targets only; safe relative PHP path, no redirects, no response body, preserving no-arbitrary-fetch and production gates."
RELEASE "0.9.15" date="2026-09-16" change="Install_transaction_bound_FreeOTP_batch_approval_for_NEW_workspace_proposals_with_post_prepare_verification"
RELEASE "0.9.16" date="2026-09-18" change="Genome-bound trusted module loader plus modules self-update allowlist; no modules activated yet"
RELEASE "0.9.17" date="2026-09-18" change="Adds KiCom protected mail credential storage, IMAPS/SMTPS TLS probes, self-loopback verification, bounded mail KCL endpoints and admin controls; no arbitrary recipient endpoint."
RELEASE "0.9.18" date="2026-09-18" change="Adds production inbound e-mail polling and attachment quarantine. ZIP attachments are hashed and quarantined only; no auto-extract, auto-execute or auto-install."
RELEASE "0.9.20" date="2026-09-18" change="Adds MAIL_UPDATE_CANDIDATES and MAIL_UPDATE_IMPORT. Quarantined mail ZIPs are re-hashed and passed through the existing verifier. Uncorroborated or YELLOW/RED packages remain staged; GREEN auto-install requires matching feed metadata."
RELEASE "0.9.21" date="2026-09-18" change="Adds MAIL_OUTBOUND_STATUS, MAIL_RECIPIENT_ALLOW_PREPARE and MAIL_SEND. New external recipients require one exact FreeOTP approval; once allowlisted, KiCom may send text mail autonomously within strict rate limits. No CC/BCC or outbound attachments in this release."
RELEASE "0.9.22" date="2026-09-18" change="Adds Slack v1 with exact team/channel allowlist, app_mentions:read + chat:write only, signed Events API endpoint, protected var/secrets provisioning in admin UI, status/probe/send/recent endpoints, no DMs/files/channel-history, and Slack content never grants authority."
EVENT "2026-09-18" change="The narrow Slack-focused 0.9.23 candidate was explicitly not installed and was superseded by the capability-first direct-transfer design."
EVENT "2026-09-18" change="Direct ChatGPT update transport implemented: public status, server-side authored builds, chunked direct ZIP upload and raw POST direct ZIP upload; no Slack/mail/GitHub dependency; all paths retain the normal self-update verifier."
EVENT "2026-09-18" change="Canonical-memory resource ceiling raised to 32 KiB to allow complete current architecture documentation."
RELEASE "0.9.24" date="2026-09-18" change="First-class direct ChatGPT update transport: server-side authoring, chunked ZIP, raw POST ZIP, shared verifier, superseded-pending history, and 32KiB canonical-memory resources"
RELEASE "0.9.25" date="2026-09-18" change="SQLite-primary operational memory with migration/dual-write mirrors, WAL, schema migrations, integrity checks, verified snapshots, automatic healing/rebuild, quarantine, shadow evolution and perception/action tables."
EVENT "2026-09-18" change="PDO SQLite, SQLite3, file DB read/write, rollback and WAL were verified live before adoption."
END_CHANGELOG kicom
